      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are many flaws with this request though, Shaders and Cameras and such could be a workaround for this using personal avatars, And the personal mirror is used to calculate FBT, important for those who use that. I feel like the better solution  would be to add the option to hide other players and pickups/UI/World layers in personal mirrors and cameras independently through Udon using Triggers, perhaps this would solve it? I'm sure there are other ways to handle it but That is up for VRChat to decide...",
